    atlas:uses <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rl_skill_discovery> .

<https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/fno> a atlas:Model ;
    rdfs:label "Fourier Neural Operator" ;
    skos:altLabel "FNO" ;
    atlas:applied_to <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/pde_operator_learning> ;
    atlas:documented_in <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/fno> ;
    atlas:extends <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn> ;
    atlas:family "neural-operator" ;
    atlas:has_component <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_lifting>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_local_path>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/fno_projection>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/spectral_convolution> ;
    atlas:label "Fourier Neural Operator" ;
    atlas:reference_year 2021 ;
    atlas:runtime_id "fno" ;
    atlas:runtime_note "길이 32의 1차원 scalar field와 좌표를 폭 8로 lifting하고 6개 Fourier mode의 spectral convolution과 pointwise local path를 결합해 출력장을 예측합니다. 원논문의 2D/3D PDE 데이터, 여러 FNO block, resolution transfer 학습과 production neuraloperator 구현은 포함하지 않습니다." ;
    atlas:summary "저주파 Fourier mode의 학습된 전역 convolution으로 함수 공간 사이의 해 연산자를 근사합니다." ;
    atlas:trained_with <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised> ;
    atlas:uses <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/fourier_operator>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neural_operator>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/resolution_invariance> .

<https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mae> a atlas:Model ;
    rdfs:label "Masked Autoencoder (MAE)" ;
    skos:altLabel "Masked Autoencoders" ;
    atlas:applied_to <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/visual_representation> ;
    atlas:documented_in <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mae> ;
    atlas:extends <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit> ;
    atlas:family "vision" ;
    atlas:has_component <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mae_decoder>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/mae_encoder>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/pixel_predictor> ;
    atlas:label "Masked Autoencoder (MAE)" ;
    atlas:reference_year 2021 ;
    atlas:runtime_id "mae" ;
    atlas:runtime_note "16개 패치 중 4개만 인코딩, 한 층 인코더/디코더. 고정 75% 마스크와 위치 버퍼, masked-pixel MSE를 쓰는 작은 예제. CLS 토큰과 공식 sin-cos 위치값은 생략합니다." ;
    atlas:summary "마스킹된 패치를 인코더에서 제외하고 디코더에서 원래 순서로 복원합니다." ;
    atlas:trained_with <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/masked_pixel_mse> ;
    atlas:uses <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/masked_pixel_reconstruction>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/visible_patch_encoding> .

<https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/moco> a atlas:Model ;
    rdfs:label "MoCo" ;
    skos:altLabel "Momentum Contrast" ;
    atlas:applied_to <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification> ;
    atlas:documented_in <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/moco> ;
    atlas:family "self-supervised" ;
    atlas:has_component <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/key_encoder>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/key_projector>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/negative_queue>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/query_encoder>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/query_projector> ;
    atlas:label "MoCo" ;
    atlas:reference_year 2020 ;
    atlas:runtime_id "moco" ;
    atlas:runtime_note "16×16 두 시점을 query/key CNN과 별도 투영기로 처리하고 16개 고정 음성 큐에 대한 logits를 계산합니다. EMA 갱신은 제공하지만 추적 중 enqueue, 분산 shuffle, 대규모 ResNet 학습과 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다." ;
    atlas:summary "모멘텀 갱신 키 인코더와 큐 기반 동적 사전으로 많은 일관된 음성 표본을 제공하는 대조 사전학습 구조입니다." ;
    atlas:trained_with <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/info_nce> ;
    atlas:uses <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/dynamic_dictionary>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/queue_negatives> .

<https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/nbeats> a atlas:Model ;
    rdfs:label "N-BEATS" ;
    skos:altLabel "Neural Basis Expansion Analysis" ;
    atlas:applied_to <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/time_series_forecasting> ;
    atlas:documented_in <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/nbeats> ;
    atlas:extends <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp> ;
    atlas:family "time-series-forecasting" ;
    atlas:has_component <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/backcast_head>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/forecast_head>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/nbeats_block_mlp>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/nbeats_block_stack> ;
    atlas:label "N-BEATS" ;
    atlas:reference_year 2020 ;
    atlas:runtime_id "nbeats" ;
    atlas:runtime_note "길이 12 history를 두 개의 generic fully connected block으로 처리해 길이 4 forecast를 생성합니다. block별 backcast subtraction과 forecast addition은 실행하지만, 원논문의 깊은 stack·trend/seasonality 해석 basis·ensemble과 대규모 M4 학습은 포함하지 않습니다." ;
    atlas:summary "fully connected block이 backcast와 forecast를 동시에 출력하고 residual history와 forecast를 서로 다른 방향으로 누적하는 시계열 예측 구조입니다." ;
    atlas:trained_with <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/point_forecasting> ;
    atlas:uses <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backcast_forecast_decomposition>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/basis_expansion>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/doubly_residual_stacking> .

<https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/neuralode> a atlas:Model ;
    rdfs:label "Neural ODE" ;
    skos:altLabel "Neural Ordinary Differential Equation" ;
    atlas:applied_to <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification> ;
    atlas:documented_in <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/neuralode> ;
    atlas:extends <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet> ;
    atlas:family "continuous-depth" ;
    atlas:has_component <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/differentiable_ode_solver>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/neural_vector_field>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ode_classifier>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ode_input_projection> ;
    atlas:label "Neural ODE" ;
    atlas:reference_year 2018 ;
    atlas:runtime_id "neuralode" ;
    atlas:runtime_note "6차원 특징을 폭 12로 투영한 뒤 작은 자율 벡터장을 4회의 explicit Euler step으로 적분하고 분류합니다. adaptive solver, adjoint O(1)-memory 역전파, event handling과 continuous normalizing flow는 포함하지 않으며 solver 경계와 벡터장 학습을 보여주는 고정 예제입니다." ;
    atlas:summary "이산 층 대신 신경망 벡터장을 적분해 연속 깊이의 은닉 상태 변환을 정의하는 구조입니다." ;
    atlas:trained_with <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised> ;
    atlas:uses <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/continuous_depth>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/differentiable_ode_solve>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/neural_vector_field> .

