        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/feature_transformer>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/tabnet_input_normalization> ;
    atlas:label "TabNet" ;
    atlas:reference_year 2021 ;
    atlas:runtime_id "tabnet" ;
    atlas:runtime_note "연속 특성 10개에 두 decision step을 적용하는 작은 예제입니다. input normalization, prior-scaled soft feature mask, gated feature transformer와 decision aggregation을 실행합니다. 원논문의 sparsemax, ghost batch normalization, shared transformer layers, categorical embedding과 self-supervised pretraining은 포함하지 않습니다." ;
    atlas:summary "여러 decision step에서 attentive mask로 표 특성을 선택하고 변환된 decision representation을 합치는 tabular architecture입니다." ;
    atlas:trained_with <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised> ;
    atlas:uses <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/decision_step_aggregation>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/feature_masking>,
        <https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sequential_feature_attention> .

